{"step_index":10773,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-25T16:15:43Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-25T19:15:43+03:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-25T19:15:43+03:00\nFile Path: `file:///d:/AI_Engineer/Pharmacy-agy-vision/desktop_app/templates/index.html`\nTotal Lines: 3632\nTotal Bytes: 149404\nShowing lines 3045 to 3090\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n3045: async function viewProcess(processId) {\n3046:     try {\n3047:         const dataStr = await window.pywebview.api.get_process_details(processId);\n3048:         const data = JSON.parse(dataStr);\n3049:         if (!data || !data.id) throw new Error(\"لم يتم العثور على العملية\");\n3050:         \n3051:         currentProcessId = processId;\n3052:         const stats = {\n3053:             total: data.total_shortages || 0,\n3054:             matched: data.matched_count || 0,\n3055:             not_found: data.not_found_count || 0,\n3056:             review: data.review_count || 0\n3057:         };\n3058:         loadResults(stats);\n3059:         window.showScreen('screen-results');\n3060:     } catch (error) {\n3061:         showToast('تعذر تحميل تفاصيل العملية', 'error');\n3062:         console.error(error);\n3063:     }\n3064: }\n3065: \n3066: // --- Settings & Server Logic ---\n3067: async function loadSettings() {\n3068:     try {\n3069:         const settings = await window.pywebview.api.get_settings();\n3070:         if (settings) {\n3071:             document.getElementById('setting-unstructured-key').value = settings.unstructured_api_key || '';\n3072:             const profileEl = document.getElementById('setting-unstructured-profile');\n3073:             if (profileEl) profileEl.value = settings.unstructured_profile || 'balanced';\n3074:             const visionUrlEl = document.getElementById('setting-vision-url');\n3075:             if (visionUrlEl) visionUrlEl.value = settings.vision_api_url || 'http://127.0.0.1:8001/v1/chat/completions';\n3076:             const visionModelEl = document.getElementById('setting-vision-model');\n3077:             if (visionModelEl) visionModelEl.value = settings.vision_model || 'gemini-3.8-flash';\n3078:             document.getElementById('setting-local-url').value = settings.local_api_url || 'http://127.0.0.1:8001/v1/chat/completions';\n3079:             document.getElementById('setting-local-key').value = settings.local_api_key || '';\n3080:             document.getElementById('setting-model-name').value = settings.local_model || 'gemini-3.8-flash';\n3081:             document.getElementById('setting-msemax-dir').value = settings.msemax_dir || '';\n3082:         }\n3083:     } catch (error) {\n3084:         console.error('Failed to load settings', error);\n3085:     }\n3086: }\n3087: \n3088: async function saveSettings() {\n3089:     const profileEl = document.getElementById('setting-unstructured-profile');\n3090:     const visionUrlEl = document.getElementById('setting-vision-url');\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
{"step_index":10774,"source":"SYSTEM","type":"CHECKPOINT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-25T16:15:43Z","content":"# Resuming from a compaction\n\nYou are continuing work on the task described above, but you have lost access to the full conversation history, and need to resume work efficiently using the progress summary below:\n\n# User Requests\nThe following were user requests from the truncated conversation in chronological order:\n1. هل اقدر اشغل البرنامج دلوقتي ؟\n2. وأنا بتابع المتصفح، هو بيوصله الـ prompt والصورة؟ أنا هبعتلك الـ log عشان أنا مش عارف هو بيقرأ من الـ cache بتاع الملفات القديمة ولا إيه، بس أنا قفلت الـ server في النص وأنا شغال. تقريبًا هو مش عارف، الصراحة أنا مش عارف هو شغال ازاي. هبعتلك الـ terminal وقولي هتلاقي فيه مشكلة أكيد. خلي بالك أنا قفلت الـ server وهو شغال. \n\nوكمان في حاجة في الـ UI، لما كنت بعمل مطابقة، الـ loading اللي هي pop-up loading دي، هي المفروض تكون في screen واحدة، أو في الـ screen اللي هي بتاعت المطابقة، المفروض تكون في المطابقة ولا السجل؟ مش عارف، مش عارف. المهم يعني المفروض تكون في screen، لما أروح مثلاً لواجهة الأوامر أو أرو\n<truncated 14028 bytes>\n3. يا ابني، أنا بقول لك الـ prompt بيتبعت من غير صورة. وشوف الـ prompt عامل ازاي، يعني حتى الـ prompt على قديمه. مش أنت كنت قائل على structure معين وحاجات معينة؟ هي فين الحاجات دي؟ اقرأ الخمس، ست، سبع، ثمان رسائل اللي هم من أول ما بدأنا الحتة دي، أول ما بدأنا النظام، أول ما بدأت الفكرة معايا. اقرأ الشات تاني من أول ما اقترحت عليك النظام ده. لازم تقرأه، لازم تقرأه سطر سطر. اقرأ الشات اللي أنا قلت لك عليه، وهتلاقيني وافقت على اللي احنا وافقنا عليه. واقرأ الأكواد اللي أنت كنت عاملها وشوف الحاجات، أنت ما بتبعتش صورة، أنت ما بتبعتش صورة. ما عرفش في إيه. لا تكون مثلاً مسيف المسار القديم \n<truncated 2924 bytes>\n4. conda venv\n5. هو انت بتعمل اي كل دا ؟؟\n6. هجرب افتح البرنامج هل كل حاجة اتصلحت ؟؟\n7. conda\n8. تمام، الصراحة أنا وقفت العملية في النص، هو بيبعت الصور تمام وبيستقبل الرد تمام ما فيهوش مشكلة، بس الـ structure، مش احنا قلنا الـ structure، حضرتك أنت بعت لي structure كويس، تمام، اللي هو الـ response المفروض يبقى شكله عامل ازاي في الرد. أنا مش عارف أنت ليه مصمم بالـ structure بتاع الموقع بتاع unstructured-transformer.io ده. أنت كنت باعت لي فوق نظام معين كويس مش عافش، فمش فاهم ليه أنت، حتى لو قلت لك اقرأ الرسائل بتاعتك القديمة، أنت تقريبا ما قريتهاش، مش عارف الصراحة. \n9. قبل ما أبدأ نظام الـ extraction ونظام الـ matching والحاجات دي، هل أنت ظبطت الـ system matching اللي هو كنا شغالين عليه قبل كده، ظبطته مع الـ structure response اللي جاي من السيرفر؟ ولا هوصل لمرحلة الـ matching وهيطلع مشكلة وارجع أقول لك في مشكلة؟ \n10. في حاجة كمان عايز أقول لك عليها، زرار بدء المطابقة متأكل تحت الـ تحت الـ ويندو، فأنا مش عارف أوصل له أصلًا. فأضبط أبعاد كل كل كل سكرين بحيث إنها تكون synchronized مع الأبعاد ومع الأشكال ومع الأحجام ومع كل حاجة، مفيش حاجة تطلع بره الإطار، كل حاجة تكون متوازنة، مضبوطة، مفيش فيها غلطات. وحوار الـ loading popup، الـ loading screen هي مضبوطة تمام، بس أنت مخليها full screen، المفروض إحنا قولنا الـ بتاعتنا two screens، السكرين اللي هي بتاع الـ menu وسكرين اللي هو بتاع الـ interact عادي، أنت عاملها full screen، لا هي المفروض تكون على السكرين بتاعت الـ menu اللي هو السكرين التاني اللي جنب الـ menu، والـ menu ده أتح\n<truncated 659 bytes>\n\n<summary>\n# Continuation Summary — Pharmacy Vision Matcher & UI Experience Polish\n\n## 1. Task Overview\n- **User Request**:\n  1. **UI Layout Clipping (\"زرار بدء المطابقة متأكل تحت الويندو\")**: The \"Start Matching\" button (`#btn-submit`) is clipped/hidden below the window edge, making it inaccessible. The user requested adjusting container dimensions and layout across all screens so that everything fits inside the viewport without overflowing, synchronized and balanced without errors.\n  2. **Scoped Loading Overlay (\"حوار الـ loading screen\")**: The loading overlay was set to full screen (`width: 100vw; height: 100vh; position: fixed`), blocking the sidebar menu. The user explicitly clarified the two-screen layout:\n     - The Sidebar Menu (الشاشة الأولى - القائمة): Must remain **completely accessible and clickable** at all times (so the user can navigate to Terminal/Logs, Settings, Servers while matching runs).\n     - The Interactive Content Screen (الشاشة الثانية جنب الـ Menu): The loading overlay must ONLY cover this content card (`#screen-new`), with the live timer and progress bar, and never obscure the sidebar.\n  3. **Automatic Report/Results Redirection**: When the process completes, the UI should **automatically open and transition to the Results Report screen** (`screen-results`) with all statistics and action buttons (Open Excel, Review, Open Folder), rather than staying on `#screen-new` or forcing the user to manually visit History.\n  4. **Strict Structured Extraction Verified**: Earlier in the conversation, the prompt and schema in `src/extract/gemini_vision_extractor.py` were upgraded to the exact agreed 5-field structure: `item_name_raw`, `trade_name`, `strength`, `form`, and `source_page`. The end-to-end matching pipeline was tested offline with conda Python and verified 100% compatible.\n\n- **Scope Boundaries & Constraints**:\n  - Keep `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy` untouched (clean baseline).\n  - All modifications in `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy-vision`.\n  - Python runtime: Always `D:\\miniconda3\\envs\\venv\\python.exe`.\n  - Both Ports `8000` (ChatGPT) and `8001` (AI Studio Vision) are currently free and verified.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Progress\n### Completed:\n1. **Root Cause Analysis of Layout Clipping**:\n   - In `desktop_app/templates/index.html`: `.main-content` had `height` unbounded and `overflow-y: hidden`.\n   - `.screen` had `flex: 1` with `overflow-y: auto`, but Flexbox items default to `min-height: auto`. This caused `.screen` to expand to content size rather than shrinking to fit the window, pushing `.action-bar-bottom` and `#btn-submit` out of view below the bottom of the viewport with no scrollbar.\n2. **Offline Pipeline Verification**:\n   - `scratch/test_matching_pipeline.py` was executed with `D:\\miniconda3\\envs\\venv\\python.exe`.\n   - Successfully verified that `FastCoordinator` handles items with `item_name_raw`, `trade_name`, `strength`, `form`, and `source_page`, matches them deterministically (`دوليبرين 1000 مجم` matched with `دوليبرين 1000مجم 30قرص س.ج 45`), and generates the complete Excel workbook via `write_results_excel` with zero errors.\n3. **Structured Prompt in Extractor**:\n   - Updated `src/extract/gemini_vision_extractor.py`, `dist_production/src/extract/gemini_vision_extractor.py`, and `scratch/test_endpoint_vision.py` with the 5-field schema.\n\n### In Progress / Remaining UI Edits:\n- The edits to `desktop_app/templates/index.html` to:\n  1. Fix `.main-content` and `.screen` CSS (`min-height: 0; height: 100vh; max-height: 100vh;`) and compact vertical margins so the action button is immediately visible or cleanly scrollable.\n  2. Scope `#progress-modal` to `position: absolute; inset: 0;` inside `#screen-new` (or `.main-content`), giving it `border-radius: var(--radius-xl)` so it only overlays the right content area, leaving `.sidebar` completely free.\n  3. Ensure `process_complete` handler calls `viewProcess(data.process_id)` or `loadResults(data.stats)` and smoothly transitions to `screen-results`.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Key Findings & Decisions\n- **CSS Flexbox Fix**: Adding `min-height: 0` to both `.main-content` and `.screen` allows the flex children to honor `height: 100vh; overflow-y: auto;`. Reducing vertical margins on `.page-header` (from 32px to 14px), `.active-server-home-bar` (from 24px to 12px), and `.drop-zone` padding ensures the \"Start Matching\" button is prominently visible without even needing to scroll on 1080p and 900p displays.\n- **Overlay Scoping**: By setting `#progress-modal` to `position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: var(--radius-xl);` inside `#screen-new`, it perfectly coats the interactive card while `.sidebar` (which has `z-index: 10;`) remains completely interactive. When the user switches to `screen-logs` or `screen-settings`, `#screen-new` gets `display: none`, naturally hiding the overlay without any intrusive viewport backdrop.\n- **Automatic Results Workflow**: In `process_complete`, calling `viewProcess(data.process_id)` guarantees that the database details, summary stats, and buttons are fully populated, and `window.showScreen('screen-results')` brings the user directly to the Excel download and review screen the second matching concludes.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Active Context\n- **Files to Modify**:\n  - `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy-vision\\desktop_app\\templates\\index.html`\n  - Sync with `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy-vision\\dist_production\\desktop_app\\templates\\index.html`\n- **Environment**:\n  - Conda Python: `D:\\miniconda3\\envs\\venv\\python.exe`\n  - Ports: 8000 and 8001 verified free.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Next Steps\n1. **Apply CSS Fixes in `desktop_app/templates/index.html`**:\n   - In `.main-content`: Add `height: 100vh; max-height: 100vh; min-height: 0;`.\n   - In `.screen`: Add `min-height: 0;`.\n   - In `#screen-new`: Ensure `position: relative; overflow-y: auto; min-height: 0;`.\n   - In `#progress-modal`: Change from `position: fixed; inset: 0; width: 100vw; height: 100vh;` to:\n     ```css\n     position: absolute;\n     inset: 0;\n     width: 100%;\n     height: 100%;\n     background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75);\n     z-index: 500;\n     display: none;\n     align-items: center;\n     justify-content: center;\n     backdrop-filter: blur(6px);\n     border-radius: var(--radius-xl);\n     ```\n   - Compact vertical spacing in `#screen-new`:\n     - `.page-header`: `margin-bottom: 14px;`\n     - `.active-server-home-bar`: `margin-bottom: 14px; padding: 10px 16px;`\n     - `.drop-zone`: `padding: 20px 14px;`\n     - `.drop-icon`: `font-size: 36px; margin-bottom: 8px;`\n     - `.action-bar-bottom`: `margin-top: 14px; padding-bottom: 16px;`\n2. **Update `process_complete` in `index.html`**:\n   - In `window.addEventListener('process_complete', (e) => { ... })`:\n     - Call `await viewProcess(data.process_id);` when `data.success` is true, or fallback to `loadResults(data.stats); window.showScreen('screen-results');`.\n3. **Sync to `dist_production`**:\n   - Run `python scratch/sync_dist.py` to keep production distribution up to date.\n4. **Inform User**:\n   - Present a clear Arabic breakdown of the three UI improvements made and prompt them to launch the desktop app via `python desktop_app\\app.py` in Conda venv.\n</summary>\n\nYou have the 385 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: agent]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.agents/agents/desktop-builder/agent.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T22:17:02Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: agent]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.agents/agents/pharmacy-builder/agent.md\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T10:46:04Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790101953275]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.tempmediaStorage/media_1790101953275.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-22T18:32:33Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790262999556]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.tempmediaStorage/media_1790262999556.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-24T15:16:39Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790340232500]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.tempmediaStorage/media_1790340232500.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-25T12:43:52Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790340237243]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.tempmediaStorage/media_1790340237243.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-25T12:43:57Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790340661274]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/.tempmediaStorage/media_1790340661274.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-25T12:51:01Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_179034079213